cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software in your work, please cite it as below.
title: kubefwd
abstract: >-
  A command-line utility for bulk Kubernetes port forwarding. kubefwd forwards
  every Service in one or more namespaces, gives each its own loopback IP and
  /etc/hosts entry so services resolve by name as they do in the cluster, and
  follows Service and Pod lifecycle events to keep forwards current.
